{
  "tema": 6807,
  "slug": "junto-juntos",
  "titulo": "Using junto, junta, juntos and juntas = together",
  "subtitulo": "Fuimos juntos, nunca vi tanta gente junta.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Junto, junta, juntos, juntas (together) agree with the noun. Mixed groups use juntos. Singular junto / junta goes with uncountable nouns: piled up.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _together_, use **junto**, **junta**, **juntos** or **juntas**. It's an adjective, so it **agrees** in gender and number with the noun it refers to."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Masculine",
            "Feminine"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "singular",
              "junto",
              "junta"
            ],
            [
              "plural",
              "juntos",
              "juntas"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With countable nouns, use the plural: **Beto y su hijo fueron juntos**, **las chicas se cambiaron juntas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With uncountable nouns, use the singular, and it has a sense of _piled up, gathered in one place_: **tanta gente junta**, **mucho polvo junto**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "A mixed group of men and women takes the masculine: **Carmen y Antonio fueron juntos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **juntos** is like a crew on the Rocinante: it matches whoever is on board."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Había mucho polvo ==junto== en el taller.",
              "en": "There was a lot of dust piled up in the shop."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nunca había visto tanta gente ==junta==.",
              "en": "I'd never seen so many people together."
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto y su hijo fueron ==juntos== al cine.",
              "en": "Beto and his son went to the movies together."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las chicas se cambiaron ==juntas== en el vestidor.",
              "en": "The girls changed together in the locker room."
            },
            {
              "es": "Holden y Naomi trabajan ==juntos==.",
              "en": "Holden and Naomi work together."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vamos a entrenar ==juntos== mañana.",
              "en": "We're going to train together tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
